Third-party work this project builds on:

- Qwen3.5-4B (huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B), Apache-2.0. The released
  configuration uses these weights unmodified. No weights are distributed here.

- JevBench (github.com/fstandhartinger/jevbench), MIT. bench/jevbench reads its
  public items from a local checkout and uses its scoring formulas; no JevBench
  data is redistributed here beyond per-item predictions keyed by item id.

- Decision Index (github.com/apolinario/decision-index), MIT.
  src/quire/adapters/decision_index.py implements its engine interface.

- kev (github.com/jaredpalmer/kev), Apache-2.0. bench/wide and the adapter
  experiments use its decision suites, read from a local checkout.

Quire is independent. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by TypeSafe AI.
"Jev" is TypeSafe AI's product name and is used here only to refer to it.
